# Import Resolution Rules

## Workspace Imports

- Use workspace dependencies and package exports for `@taskflow/*` imports.
- Do not recreate workspace imports with TypeScript-only path aliases.
- Inside a shared package, use relative imports for implementation internals instead of self-importing through the package name.

## Local Aliases

- `@web/*` is allowed inside `apps/web` because the alias is declared in the local TypeScript config and resolved by the web runtime.
- Do not add new local aliases unless the runtime or bundler resolves them too.
- Runtime resolution is the source of truth; avoid editor-only or test-only aliases.
